<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  The app's own words, in English (the default). The Hebrew ones are in values-iw/strings.xml (Android's folder name
  for Hebrew); every string here needs one there too (lint checks). What the assistant writes, and the reply buttons
  under its messages, aren't here: they follow the language you write in (logic/Texts.kt, logic/ChipRules.kt).
  The Diagnostics screen and its tests stay in English, like the log they show.
-->
